##  Limitations

This is an internship/project demonstration workflow and should not be
treated as a production hiring system without additional security,
privacy, compliance, audit, bias/fairness, access-control, and
operational safeguards.

The AI score and recommendation are assistive signals, not authoritative
hiring decisions.

